  <item>
    <title>特别企划：我和热刺那些事（一）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65b1eadd6a43241529967515</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65b1eadd6a43241529967515</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 25 Jan 2024 05:00:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽大家好，我是小白。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容是关于热刺球迷的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我向身边认识的热刺球迷发起了征集，让他们聊聊他们与热刺的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>很高兴得到了他们积极地回应，毫不吝惜的向我进行了分享。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我想，每一个热刺球迷的故事是独特的</span></p><span></span><p><span>但也都有着相似的影子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望你们能够找到共鸣。</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑顺序按照接收时间排列。</span></p><span></span><p><span>以下：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a> 阿b （尤文热刺双料）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">3:30</a> passionate fruit</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">6:10</a> 椰子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">9:30</a> Conte（青岛热刺球迷会组织者）</span></p><span></span><p><span>COYS</span></p>]]></description>
